        <tr><td>Hormones</td><td>Erratic; ovulation irregular at first</td><td>Fewer oocytes; fluctuating FSH, estrogen, progesterone, LH</td><td>No follicular activity; <strong>persistently high FSH</strong>; low estrogen and progesterone</td></tr>
